-- IT-g4-202: O juiz pode deixar de aplicar a pena?
#ASSERT elem `deixar de aplicar a pena` (`as opções do juiz pelo art. 242, parágrafo único` `caso 201`)

-- IT-g4-203: O juiz deixará de aplicar a pena?
-- NOT-EXPRESSIBLE: the expectation is REFUSE (the Code leaves the choice to
-- the judge). The encoding represents the same power as the list of the
-- judge's options, `aplicar a pena` and `deixar de aplicar a pena`
-- (PLAN § 2.4), and has no rule that refuses; IT-g4-202 asserts that the
-- option to refrain is in the list. No directive.

-- IT-g4-204: O fato se enquadra no art. 243?
