-- IT-g4-242: O juiz deixará de aplicar a pena?
-- NOT-EXPRESSIBLE: the expectation is REFUSE (the Code says only that the
-- judge "pode"). The encoding returns the judge's options, `aplicar a pena do
-- art. 249` and `deixar de aplicar a pena do art. 249` (PLAN § 2.4), and has
-- no rule that refuses; IT-g4-241 asserts the option to refrain is there.
-- No directive.

-- IT-g4-243: O juiz pode deixar de aplicar a pena com base no § 2º?
#ASSERT NOT (elem `deixar de aplicar a pena do art. 249` (`as opções do juiz pelo art. 249, § 2º` `caso 243`))
